{"schema_version":1,"status":"complete","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01374-s00","batch":1374,"shard":0,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":0,"shard_end_exclusive":20,"translated_count":20,"entries":[{"entry_index":0,"uid":"zhcn:83d4f9973d414da0eef011de","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"状态也还不错，只要努力了的话就…啊。开，开玩笑！玩笑玩笑～。","source_fingerprint":"d3928ef9d5130dda6c8303044acf85435c492a24d2d52404c11c7bb36084ac75","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20025"],"target_text":"Tình trạng cũng khá ổn, chỉ cần cố gắng thì… à. Đ-đùa thôi! Đùa thôi mà～.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":1,"uid":"zhcn:b2c6e0b776b494724c5f511e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"嘛，能做的事都做了。\n之后就看跑的怎样了！","source_fingerprint":"fbc016307b2039e5e1f64676621a7c3c0cd941390ae3a58d4f4be3ffa8bb9f86","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20026"],"target_text":"Chà, những gì có thể làm thì đã làm hết rồi.\nGiờ chỉ còn xem mình chạy thế nào thôi!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":2,"uid":"zhcn:28a3724f956b2a00ab96f32b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我觉得冷静地跑，\n跟着人流就行了。\n啊…差不多吧，马马虎虎！","source_fingerprint":"cf6faddb74510098b3a6d93781637e74bffb6db92acd2248f727dc85afcba7ae","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20027"],"target_text":"Tôi nghĩ cứ bình tĩnh chạy,\ntheo dòng người là được.\nÀ… đại khái vậy, tàm tạm thôi!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":3,"uid":"zhcn:d4776a947b3e086bddd3b308","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"对我来说，做得很好了。对我来说呢！ 这个，真的很重要。","source_fingerprint":"3c2e264ade3d29dea005dd2915295fbb0ac47ea0e0eb984d3771f0ec350859a4","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20028"],"target_text":"Với tôi thì thế này đã rất tốt rồi. Với tôi ấy nhé! Điều đó thật sự rất quan trọng.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":4,"uid":"zhcn:301551c4c38e34afc1e6a50c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好像能和平时一样奔跑呢…\n这是好事还是坏事呢…","source_fingerprint":"27f0fc45a8bded11587d340f914c4906392dd0dd53530787e376e3e206ecacca","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20029"],"target_text":"Có vẻ vẫn chạy như mọi khi được nhỉ…\nKhông biết thế là tốt hay xấu nữa…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":5,"uid":"zhcn:5a3f1575a02b6444d4f46282","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"因为是和平时一样的状态，\n所以…也和平时一样\n期待着就行了。","source_fingerprint":"36a9e721dfc51fd8f50f46c44dea80bddf51234b7f3b3a28ccf4d398ad73b75f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20030"],"target_text":"Vì tình trạng vẫn như mọi khi,\nnên… cứ kỳ vọng\nnhư mọi khi là được.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":6,"uid":"zhcn:435ab5e235905716883c0b5b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"状态不好也不坏。\n能好好比赛就好了啊ー。","source_fingerprint":"e36e71e585f53bf6cfe8e7a63dbd4311c78c68b58c70df45acb54fca971d6f34","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20031"],"target_text":"Tình trạng không tốt cũng chẳng xấu.\nMong là có thể đua cho đàng hoàngー.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":7,"uid":"zhcn:77fca24c547cd85ba355e293","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"已经到正式演出了吗。\n嗯…既然到了这个时候\n就只有平心静气了吧…","source_fingerprint":"c7c7d03e742b6d74feb85e4ba9e0ccf2885e638498989f9958e81b6d822b5509","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20032"],"target_text":"Đã đến lúc thi thật rồi à.\nỪm… tới nước này thì\nchỉ còn bình tĩnh thôi nhỉ…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":8,"uid":"zhcn:8ff112febb38476e74096964","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"啊ー…加油跑的话\n奇迹什么的会发生吧～？","source_fingerprint":"e2404905e5b0d0837ce9d019aedca680fb3273bd0c21c3f15fdb11b7a9207a50","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20033"],"target_text":"Àー… nếu cố gắng chạy,\nbiết đâu phép màu sẽ xảy ra nhỉ～?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":9,"uid":"zhcn:51da1ff6932681eab5fb4999","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"不管怎么抱怨，\n现状都不会改变的。\n调整好心态，继续跑吧","source_fingerprint":"2a96eb833a0b9903de2d331eb305df38674fa09fb06a01984e04043406981a47","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20034"],"target_text":"Có than thở thế nào\nthì tình hình cũng chẳng thay đổi.\nChỉnh lại tinh thần rồi chạy tiếp thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":10,"uid":"zhcn:098bce81a9632ab35a66e2d8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"哎呀ー。说实话我很不安…\n但能做的事我一定会做好的。","source_fingerprint":"ff079704cb56cc3c3bad13949db95318f47bad26bb5df8141a12321e458bbe92","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20035"],"target_text":"Ôi chàー. Nói thật là tôi lo lắm…\nNhưng những gì làm được, tôi nhất định sẽ làm cho tốt.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":11,"uid":"zhcn:7df423d9c715c82722f50afa","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"嗯…都到这里了\n如果还对自己没有信心的话，\n也说不过吧？大概。","source_fingerprint":"238e24e45679ca15e74d61977cb39984682aaf28ca97e4db13bc460d656e6cdc","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20036"],"target_text":"Ừm… đã đi tới tận đây rồi,\nnếu vẫn không tin vào bản thân\nthì cũng khó nói nhỉ? Chắc vậy.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":12,"uid":"zhcn:a961467bcef0b3107617a56d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"努力到这种地步了，\n怎么也要留下点痕迹啊。","source_fingerprint":"5c610e17674dc005bfc349c0f631515d7d6b65b4dac1c9bda6062cfb48fd709d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20037"],"target_text":"Đã cố gắng đến mức này rồi,\nthế nào cũng phải để lại chút dấu ấn chứ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":13,"uid":"zhcn:949eae22e9de52ebd9e48b72","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"明白了。","source_fingerprint":"2a2d68c4ff9cf3599c629adf9fd7b4ee5f4b10e6408f421a524401a5087b17b5","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20038"],"target_text":"Hiểu rồi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":14,"uid":"zhcn:8bb2623a60c263d0c26ff4ec","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"加油。","source_fingerprint":"d3837c0fb988527b79ed372344d6392747daee0d5861d57996ea30f7e1ba5c1b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20039"],"target_text":"Cố lên.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":15,"uid":"zhcn:293a66065cfa01648900d1a1","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"嘿ー。","source_fingerprint":"ab4ee3880fd7ffb923130db5b8d60bf5ad947b02f33226199f1b15a4d9fa9e37","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20040"],"target_text":"Hâyー.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":16,"uid":"zhcn:0ee6bcc720cc9053b688acf1","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"学习时间。","source_fingerprint":"454a4374f92debea49725f95a733f5dc9b2805be183ef8ad2ce4ce4db0a4ef80","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20041"],"target_text":"Đến giờ học rồi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":17,"uid":"zhcn:5fdace8ca0f033350022d0d3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"哎呀。","source_fingerprint":"f6d09d3bf68ecfe25b03c1bbfa1cc896088838b9b654cf7cddb2ba7226922267","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20042"],"target_text":"Ôi chà.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":18,"uid":"zhcn:44c30f95e0387316e459449d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"哎呀…","source_fingerprint":"d17809827b0889e5a0b80dbad0f7eef8501c7ca15d5376b38cd26eaa7264a2e2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20043"],"target_text":"Ôi chà…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":19,"uid":"zhcn:c93788797218b44373ec0d04","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"嗯。出发吧","source_fingerprint":"65e3f8a518570a7a076b68813c9b4af92070553bbf2927a436812d5769b4bc45","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","20046"],"target_text":"Ừ. Xuất phát thôi.","reviewed":true}]}